{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24130","headline":"洛中春游呈诸亲友 · 白居易","name":"洛中春游呈诸亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫叹年将暮，须怜岁又新。\n府中三遇腊，洛下五逢春。\n春树花珠颗，春塘水麴尘。\n春娃无气力，春马有精神。\n并辔鞭徐动，连盘酒慢巡。\n经过旧邻里，追逐好交亲。\n笑语销闲日，酣歌送老身。\n一生欢乐事，亦不少於人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}